flowchart TD
    A([runCausalReasoningEngine\ncalled]) --> B[formatPhysicsContext\nformatDamageContext\nformatEnrichedPhotos\nbuildPoliceBlock]

    B --> C[Pass 1: definePhysicsConstraints\nLLM call GPT-4o\ndefines expected physics\nconstraints for this incident type]

    C --> D[Pass 2: checkConstraints\nevaluate each constraint\nagainst actual physics\nand damage outputs]

    D --> E[generateConstraintNarrative\nLLM call GPT-4o\nforensic analysis prompt\ncontradiction identification]

    E --> F[plausibilityBand\nmap score to band:\n85-100 fully consistent\n65-84 minor inconsistencies\n45-64 moderate contradictions\n0-44 major or critical]

    F --> G{flagForFraud\nset?}
    G -- Yes --> H[fraud flag raised\nplausibilityScore below 45\nor major contradiction]
    G -- No --> I[clean verdict]

    H --> J[buildCausalVerdict:\nplausibilityScore, band\ncontradictions, narrative\nalternative causes]
    I --> J

    J --> K{Engine\nfailed?}
    K -- Yes --> L[buildFallbackVerdict\ndefault plausibility 50\nno contradictions]
    K -- No --> M([return CausalVerdict])
    L --> M

    style A fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style M fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style L fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828
